OL,3,GNEWSAHow Bournemouth shaped Gareth
OL,4,AMalone's life in music
OL,5,
OL,6,FChoirmaster Gareth Malone has been
OL,7,Freflecting on his formative years in
OL,8,Fmusic while growing up in Dorset,
OL,9,Fcalling it an "amazing time".
OL,11,FThe Choir star will be returning to his
OL,12,Fchildhood hometown of Bournemouth as
OL,13,Fpart of a 15-date tour of his latest
OL,14,Fsingalong show.
OL,16,FMalone, who attended Bournemouth
OL,17,FSchool, said he remembered there being
OL,18,F"so many musical opportunities" in the
OL,19,Ftown and he "did them all".
